WMDE desktop bundle
====================

Installing this package pulls the full WMDE environment in one step:
session, compositor, panel, applets, applications, themes and fonts.

Qt6/KDE applications pick up the WMDE palette through qt6ct
(see wmde-desktop / wmde-session packaging notes).

Vulkan is the only renderer backend: make sure a Vulkan ICD is installed
(mesa-vulkan-drivers covers most hardware). Without one, the stack falls
back to the tiny-skia software renderer.
